<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Orthologic Corp.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Orthologic Corp.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Hambrecht &amp; Quist downgraded Orthologic to HOLD citing the company's announcement Tuesday that it expects third qtr EPS of $0.02 to $0.04 vs H&amp;Q's forecast of $0.08.</p>
<p>-- H&amp;Q lowered 1996 EPS to $0.18 from $0.28 and cut its revenue forecast to $42 million from $47.7 million. 1997 estimate reduced to $0.34 from $0.58 and revenue forecast cut to $76.2 million from $90.5 million.</p>
<p>-- Orthologic down 4-1/8 to 7-1/4.</p>
</text>
